<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 12 million range warrants, in four equal tranches, on the dollar/mark rate, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	    RANGE	    ISS PRICE	    MATURITY</p>
<p> TRANCHE A	   1.50-1.58	5.17 DEM	     01.APR.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE B	   1.52-1.60	5.11 DEM	     01.APR.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE C	   1.50-1.58	4.10 DEM	     30.MAY.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE D	   1.52-1.60	4.02 DEM	     30.MAY.97</p>
<p>PAYDATE 30.DEC.96</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.55</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
